{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51296","headline":"题阮客旧居（《全唐诗》二六二作李阳冰，第三句「到」《诗话总龟》作「得」） · 李?","name":"题阮客旧居（《全唐诗》二六二作李阳冰，第三句「到」《诗话总龟》作「得」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空（赵明诚《金石录》云：《题阮客旧居诗》，小篆书，《集古录》以爲阳冰作。\n验其姓名，乃缙云今李{茊/山}，非阳冰也。\n其字画亦不工。\n盖阳冰肃宗上元中尝令缙运，其篆字石刻，尚多有存者，故欧阳公亦误以此诗爲阳冰作尔。\n○《诗话总龟》二九《正讹门》〖赵明诚语见《金石录》卷三十，「李{茊/山}」作「李𬜪」\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李?","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}